KOT-28.worked_example_ar:
مثال يوضح تصميم Result API منيع الأنواع يحافظ على سياق التشخيص:
```kotlin
sealed interface ApiResult<out T, out E> {
    data class Success<T>(val value: T) : ApiResult<T, Nothing>
    data class Failure<E>(val error: E) : ApiResult<Nothing, E>
}

sealed interface OrderError {
    data class ValidationError(val invalidFields: Map<String, String>) : OrderError
    data class PaymentFailed(val code: String, val canRetry: Boolean) : OrderError
    data class NetworkTimeout(val correlationId: String, val cause: Throwable) : OrderError
}

fun handleOrder(result: ApiResult<Receipt, OrderError>) {
    when (result) {
        is ApiResult.Success -> showSuccess(result.value)
        is ApiResult.Failure -> when (val err = result.error) {
            is OrderError.ValidationError -> showFieldErrors(err.invalidFields)
            is OrderError.PaymentFailed -> showRetryPrompt(err.code, err.canRetry)
            is OrderError.NetworkTimeout -> logAndShowOffline(err.correlationId, err.cause)
        }
    }
}
```
الكود يتيح للواجهة التعامل مع تفاصيل الخطأ بدقة، ويرسل correlationId للتشخيص.

